VENG's design draws on ideas from Memvid (https://github.com/memvid/memvid,
Apache-2.0): versioned memory cards that supersede older facts, adaptive
retrieval cutoffs, and replayable agent sessions. Where a later release adapts
Memvid code rather than the idea, that file will say so in its header.
